{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach then take it. Check object properties in order to complete task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDifferentArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = CanTakeObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
